## Directory Structure

```
docs/DOCROLEBASE/
├── 00-overview/        ← system overview, glossary, flows, state machines
├── 01-public/          ← public booking, subdomain, SEO
├── 02-student/         ← student dashboard
├── 03-instructor/      ← instructor dashboard & features
├── 04-business/        ← multi-provider (⚠️ Coming Soon)
├── 05-admin/           ← admin panel
├── 06-payments/        ← wallet, commissions, payouts, receipts
├── 07-subscriptions/   ← tiers, billing, trial
└── 08-technical/       ← webhooks, codebase map, API reference

.kiro/steering/         ← AI agent standing instructions (always loaded)
  ├── platform-model.md   ← core mental model + quick facts
  └── doc-sync.md         ← doc update rules

docs/newplan/           ← planning notes (NOT living docs — do not update)
```

